t-against-Lukoil-for-93-Million/default.aspx'], date_publish='2013-07-17'), EvidenceClaim(claim_text='As of July 21, 2015, Romanian prosecutors were investigating LUKOIL and its subsidiaries, including Petrotel Lukoil and Lukoil Europe Holdings BV Netherlands, for alleged tax evasion, money laundering, and corruption, with asset seizures totaling up to 2 billion euros imposed as part of the probe, making it the largest such investigation in Romania at the time.', claim_type='investigation', supporting_urls=['https://revista22.ro/opinii/mariana-bechir/dosarul-lukoil-evaziune-splare-de-bani-i-corupie'], date_publish='2015-07-21'), EvidenceClaim(claim_text="On April 27, 2009, complaints were filed with the Compliance Advisor Ombudsman of the IFC and MIGA alleging that Lukoil Overseas Karachaganak B.V., as a partner in the Karachaganak project in Kazakhstan, breached environmental and social legislation and IFC policies, including involuntary resettlement requirements; the CAO audit found general compliance but noted unresolved issues, and allegations of fraud and corruption were referred to the World Bank's Department of Institutional Integrity, with no formal findings against LUKOIL reported.", claim_type='allegation', supporting_urls=['https://aconsole-static.s3.amazonaws.com/media/public/cases/KPO-3FinalAssessmentReport_Russian.pdf'], date_publish='2009-04-27'), EvidenceClaim(claim_text='On December 23, 2016, Romanian authorities were conducting an active criminal investigation into Petrotel Lukoil, a LUKOIL subsidiary, for alleged tax evasion and money laundering amounting to 1 billion lei, involving asset freezes and scrutiny of asset valuation practices, with no final findings or charges reported at that time.', claim_type='investigation', supporting_urls=['https://www.riseproject.ro/investigations/uncategorized/megaevaziunea-fiscala-a-lukoil-una-la-judecator-alta-la-perceptor/'], date_publish='2016-12-23'), EvidenceClaim(claim_text='On April 6, 2016, LUKOIL and its subsidiaries were under investigation by Bulgarian authorities for alleged cartel collusion and price-fixing in the fuel market, and by Romanian authorities for fraud and money laundering, with the Romanian case seeing charges filed and later dismissed by the court; no convictions or penalties were reported as of that date.', claim_type='investigation', supporting_urls=['https://ru.wikinews.org/wiki/%D0%92_%D0%BE%D1%84%D0%B8%D1%81%D0%B0%D1%85_%C2%AB%D0%9B%D1%83%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B9%D0%BB%D0%B0%C2%BB_%D0%B2_%D0%91%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%B3%D0%B0%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%B8_%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%88%D0%BB%D0%B8_%D0%BE%D0%B1%D1%8B%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8_%D0%BF%D0%BE_%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%BB%D1%83_%D0%BE_%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%80%D1%83%D1%88%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B8_%D0%B0%D0%BD%D1%82%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BE_%D0%B7%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BB%D1%8C%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%B0'], date_publish='2016-04-06'), EvidenceClaim(claim_text="On March 11, 2020, LUKOIL's Romanian subsidiary Petrotel Lukoil S.A. and its management were the subject of a high-profile investigation for alleged tax evasion and money laundering between 2011 and 2014, with asset freezes imposed and subsequent acquittals in 2017 and 2018, but the case remained under judicial review following prosecution appeals as of the last update.", claim_type='investigation', supporting_urls=['https://neftegaz.ru/news/arbitrage/533139-sud-rumynii-vozobnovil-delo-protiv-petrotel-lukoil-s-a-dochki-lukoyla-/'], date_publish='2020-03-11'), EvidenceClaim(claim_text='On November 14, 2025, multiple allegations and suspicions of financial crime, including money laundering and organized crime infiltration, were reported in relation to LUKOIL and Monaco-based Sotrama S.A.M. (now CINPIT S.A.M.), with references to law enforcement and intelligence reports, but no formal regulatory or criminal findings against LUKOIL itself were documented.', claim_type='allegation', supporting_urls=['https://tbcarchives.org/category/lukoil/'], date_publish='2025-11-14'), EvidenceClaim(claim_text='On April 23, 2025, Archangel Diamond Corporation Liquidating Trust filed a civil lawsuit in Colorado federal court against LUKOIL, alleging mail and wire fraud, money laundering, racketeering, and unjust enrichment in connection with a failed diamond joint venture, seeking $3.6 billion in damages; the allegations remain unproven and are the subject of ongoing litigation.', claim_type='allegation', supporting_urls=['https://courthousenews.com/diamond-miners-sue-lukoil-for-1-2-billion/'], date_publish='2025-04-23'), EvidenceClaim(claim_text='On September 18, 2025, LUKOIL-Moldova, a subsidiary of LUKOIL, was under investigation by Moldovan anti-corruption authorities for suspected money laundering and illegal financing of political parties and media, with over 20 million Moldovan lei seized as evidence; the investigation was ongoing with no charges or convictions reported at that time.', claim_type='investigation', supporting_urls=['https://www.profit.ro/povesti-cu-profit/vecini/republica-electorala-moldova-coruptie-electorala-operatiunea-pro-rusa-lukoil-moldova-si-razboaie-politice-22168882'], date_publish='2025-09-18'), EvidenceClaim(claim_text='On November 30, 2025, LUKOIL and its subsidiaries were subject to ongoing criminal proceedings in Romania for alleged money laundering and illegal fund transfers totaling nearly 1.8 billion euros, with asset seizures in place and active US sanctions further complicating operations; the case involved multiple jurisdictions and remained unresolved.', claim_type='investigation', supporting_urls=['https://ziare.com/lukoil/sechestru-active-companie-vanzare-companie-1979759'], date_publish='2025-11-30'), EvidenceClaim(claim_text="On October 22, 2025, the U.S. Department of the Treasury's Office of Foreign Assets Control (OFAC) designated LUKOIL and certain subsidiaries as Specially Designated Nationals, imposing comprehensive U.S. sanctions that prohibit most transactions and freeze assets under U.S. jurisdiction, with related general licenses authorizing only limited negotiations for asset sales, and similar sanctions imposed by the EU and UK; these measures have resulted in operational disruptions, asset freezes, and forced divestitures across multiple jurisdictions.", claim_type='sanction_listing', supporting_urls=['https://ofac.treasury.gov/faqs/1224', 'https://interfax.com/newsroom/top-stories/119192/', 'https://fesenkolaw.com/ru/blog2/sankczii-protiv-lukojla-ofac-v-chetvertyj-raz-prodlevaet-liczenziyu-na-peregovory-o-prodazhe-lukoil-international-gmbh', 'https://www.dw.com/ru/bloomberg-lukojl-pytalsa-vyjti-na-rynok-torgovli-zernom/a-75852975', 'https://tass.ru/ekonomika/27950055', 'https://www.acerislaw.com/lukoil-arbitration-cases/', 'https://www.svoboda.org/a/prodavay-poka-vygodno/33588288.html', 'https://www.dw.com/ru/zarubeznye-aktivy-lukojla-prodadut-kompanii-gunvor/a-74554086', 'https://www.profit.ro/povesti-cu-profit/energie/scandalul-lukoil-efecte-in-romania-ce-operatiuni-au-voie-sa-efectueze-companiile-lukoil-din-romania-si-pana-cand-22244937', 'https://eurodebt.eu/ru/%D0%9A%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%BF%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F-Petrotel-Lukoil-%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%B8%D0%BB%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%8C--460-%D1%80%D1%83%D0%BC%D1%8B%D0%BD%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8%D1%85-%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%BF%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B9-%D0%BD%D0%B0-%D0%B3%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8-%D0%B1%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%82%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%B0--%D0%BE%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%BB%D1%8C-TSL-%D0%BE%D1%85%D0%B2%D0%B0%D1%87%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B0-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B6%D0%B0%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%BC./', 'https://romania.europalibera.org/a/controlul-mafiei-in-bulgaria-gerb-dps-bsp-si-itn-au-convenit-ca-un-administrator-de-stat-ar-putea-vinde-activele-lukoil/33584335.html', 'https://www.zf.ro/companii/energie/cazul-lukoil-ar-lua-rafinaria-petrotel-tinta-unuia-dintre-cele-mari-22949076'], date_publish='2025-10-28')]
