vestigation for alleged tax evasion and money laundering, with initial asset freezes of up to €2 billion, multiple acquittals, and continued judicial review following prosecution appeals.", claim_type='investigation', supporting_urls=['https://neftegaz.ru/news/arbitrage/533139-sud-rumynii-vozobnovil-delo-protiv-petrotel-lukoil-s-a-dochki-lukoyla-/'], date_publish='2020-03-11'), EvidenceClaim(claim_text='On September 18, 2025, Moldovan authorities were investigating LUKOIL-Moldova for suspected money laundering and illegal political party financing, with raids resulting in the seizure of over 20 million Moldovan lei in evidence.', claim_type='investigation', supporting_urls=['https://www.profit.ro/povesti-cu-profit/vecini/republica-electorala-moldova-coruptie-electorala-operatiunea-pro-rusa-lukoil-moldova-si-razboaie-politice-22168882'], date_publish='2025-09-18'), EvidenceClaim(claim_text='On November 30, 2025, Romanian courts maintained asset seizures valued at approximately $2 billion against LUKOIL Holdings BV (Netherlands) and Petrotel-Lukoil refinery as part of a decade-long criminal investigation into alleged money laundering and illegal fund transfers totaling nearly €1.8 billion.', claim_type='investigation', supporting_urls=['https://ziare.com/lukoil/sechestru-active-companie-vanzare-companie-1979759'], date_publish='2025-11-30'), EvidenceClaim(claim_text='On April 23, 2025, Archangel Diamond Corporation Liquidating Trust filed a civil lawsuit in Colorado federal court against LUKOIL, alleging mail and wire fraud, money laundering, racketeering, and unjust enrichment in connection with a failed diamond joint venture in Russia, seeking $3.6 billion in damages.', claim_type='allegation', supporting_urls=['https://courthousenews.com/diamond-miners-sue-lukoil-for-1-2-billion/'], date_publish='2025-04-23'), EvidenceClaim(claim_text="On April 27, 2009, NGOs filed complaints with the Compliance Advisor Ombudsman of the IFC and MIGA alleging that Lukoil Overseas Ka